geoglyph bundles data derived from two outside sources. Neither narrows what this
package may be used for; both are named here because they should be.

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
COUNTRY OUTLINES — generated/shape/

Derived from Natural Earth 1:50m Admin 0 – Map subunits.

    https://www.naturalearthdata.com
    https://github.com/nvkelso/natural-earth-vector

Natural Earth is in the public domain. Its terms of use ask for no permission and
require no attribution, and explicitly disclaim any need for either. This notice
is here because a package that ships someone else's coastlines should say whose.

The shapes here are not the source data. Each has been projected, simplified,
cropped to one landmass and reframed on its own origin — see the README.

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
